ined graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Ups - </strong>Boost to help drive, cause damage, or increase speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Leaderboards </strong>- Compete against others and see how you stack up against the competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Camera Options</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Active Development:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suggest a mode or idea. Your input could help the future of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by single developer</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race, Crash, Explode, Outrun Aliens. Upgrade your car. Get a new one. Run over people. Escape sharks. Fly off jumps. Just have fun. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Racing</strong>: Race on streets with traffic and pedestrians</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/58cf984c89ccbcaf93f4ee6550f75985.poster.avif?t=1779168744\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/58cf984c89ccbcaf93f4ee6550f75985.webm?t=1779168744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/58cf984c89ccbcaf93f4ee6550f75985.mp4?t=1779168744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Race</strong>: Hit people and make check points to increase your score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/0f2c63f37840f9797ad76f9